  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, thank you. Good afternoon. This is Declan Brennan. I'm calling for my mother about recycling. Thank you for taking the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Declan. What would you like to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She wants to know what can go in the recycling now. Pizza boxes, glass, and those plastic clamshells, the ones berries come in. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, pizza boxes, glass, and clamshells. Generally clean ones are fine, but greasy pizza boxes are an issue. Glass is accepted, and clamshells are usually okay if they're rinsed. I can have the current list mailed to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:50:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be great, thank you. Is there a fee for any of it? Sorry, I should say I'm in the break area at work, so I'm keeping it short."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:51:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. There's no separate fee for regular curbside recycling, as far as I know. Do you want that list sent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:51:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please. I appreciate it. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll take her address and get it out. Go ahead whenever you're ready."
    }
  ],
